.TH std::counting_semaphore::~counting_semaphore 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::counting_semaphore::~counting_semaphore \- std::counting_semaphore::~counting_semaphore

.SH Synopsis
~counting_semaphore();  \fI(since C++20)\fP

Destroys the counting_semaphore object.

.SH Notes

It is only safe to invoke the destructor if all threads have been notified. The programmer
must ensure that no threads attempt to wait on *this once the destructor has been started.
The destructor does not notify and release any waiting threads.
